# Keep the build context small, and keep anything private out of it entirely.
# A file that never enters the context cannot end up in a layer.
#
# `fixtures/` is deliberately *not* excluded, unlike `docs/`: the component
# gallery imports the synthetic dataset at build time (W07), so `next build`
# needs it in the context. It is invented data, and it is the only data this
# repository is allowed to contain — the exclusion above protects `seed/`,
# which is the real one.

.git/
seed/
exports/
screenshots/
*-private.md
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.github/privacy-denylist.local.txt

node_modules/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.next/
**/coverage/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

docs/
seed.example/
.claude/
README.md
STATUS.md
LICENSE
